<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Anglo appoints SAfrica's Ramaphosa to board.</title>
<headline>Anglo appoints SAfrica's Ramaphosa to board.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo American Corporation of South Africa Ltd said on Friday it had appointed Johnnic chairman Cyril Ramaphosa and JCI Ltd chairman Mzi Khumalo as non-executive members of the Anglo board.</p>
<p>The positiions are effective immediately.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
